                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b70a7828-7c36-4ffe-bb45-cac931e94898",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe69e679-2171-31d7-9089-addf3e651c49",
                        "source_sense_id": "a5042e4a-0e1a-374b-8648-eaaec4578041",
                        "source_sense_description": "abwertend: ein Mensch, der jemanden blendet, also betrügt; Betrüger, Hochstapler",
                        "target_lang_word": "обманщик",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "обманщик",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "358043e1-8a40-3eb4-abcd-2e3e5687dcdd",
                                        "entry_id": "b36dbe7c-2990-34f9-ba55-aaeea9137f38",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "тот, кто обманул или обманывает кого-либо"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c69eadd-1f80-4fb6-8b43-1695afbae559",
                                                "sense_id": "358043e1-8a40-3eb4-abcd-2e3e5687dcdd",
                                                "text": "Назвать его в глаза обманщиком ― было подвергнуть себя погибели; и то, на что был я готов под виселицею в глазах всего народа и в первом пылу негодования, теперь казалось мне бесполезной хвастливостию."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ea49911-7a71-4581-8033-6d1fff730534",
                                                "sense_id": "358043e1-8a40-3eb4-abcd-2e3e5687dcdd",
                                                "text": "— Что любовь! — заметила она, — это пагубное чувство; мужчины все такие обманщики…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db9d568e-4419-4f1d-a9f7-50abf952e799",
                                                "sense_id": "358043e1-8a40-3eb4-abcd-2e3e5687dcdd",
                                                "text": "Злые же люди и обманщики будут преуспевать во зле, вводя в заблуждение и заблуждаясь."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0df2cc4f-dfc7-4a8f-8fb1-2b573d3f5ca9",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe69e679-2171-31d7-9089-addf3e651c49",
                        "source_sense_id": "534d7f26-5f66-352a-8fab-ce9aff3e6c07",
                        "source_sense_description": "abwertend: ein Angeber",
                        "target_lang_word": "show-off",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "show-off",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d348d115-a0f4-37d0-a2d2-23b617372f21",
                                        "entry_id": "ba9cab3a-d8fe-3b35-8956-0349f2eed8c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who shows off; a person given to egotistically demonstrating their prowess or ability."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28745b27-9973-467a-ae25-1882516dce7b",
                                                "sense_id": "d348d115-a0f4-37d0-a2d2-23b617372f21",
                                                "text": "Quit being such a show-off, before someone gets hurt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8055650-3827-445a-b20b-cacf944fff6f",
                                                "sense_id": "d348d115-a0f4-37d0-a2d2-23b617372f21",
                                                "text": "“Don’t tell me what to do, you double-crossing little show-off!” he grated. “Here, stand aside there, and let a man pass.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ffda4ea-a9fb-4f2c-8c57-7142f540c7fb",
                                                "sense_id": "d348d115-a0f4-37d0-a2d2-23b617372f21",
                                                "text": "He was still a tad disgruntled about being used as a work-horse, but he allowed this feeling to be repressed in favor of the pomp and circumstance of the parade. He was, after all, a bit of a show-off when he could get away with it. And that is a real understatement!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2127bd20-1a9a-415c-930f-5524634742ec",
                                                "sense_id": "d348d115-a0f4-37d0-a2d2-23b617372f21",
                                                "text": "Totally obsessive fans are a good measure of a ride’s popularity, but they’re kind of a pain in the ass, too. They lipsynch the soundtrack, cadge souvenirs and pester you with smarmy, show-off questions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e17b4e4-c9e8-46fe-ac84-7a6237e70d9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe69e679-2171-31d7-9089-addf3e651c49",
                        "source_sense_id": "534d7f26-5f66-352a-8fab-ce9aff3e6c07",
                        "source_sense_description": "abwertend: ein Angeber",
                        "target_lang_word": "frimeur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "frimeur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c08b549b-4139-3dea-b8dd-0968ea161072",
                                        "entry_id": "620b4494-09f3-3621-8834-949de1e7ece0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui frime ou qui crâne ; prétentieux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2335f86-744f-4649-8127-6490a9d39286",
                                                "sense_id": "c08b549b-4139-3dea-b8dd-0968ea161072",
                                                "text": "Les m'as-tu-vu se recrutent dans toutes les classes. Inconnus on les appelle des frimeurs. Connus ils portent le nom de vedettes. La démarche des frimeurs vise essentiellement à accéder au vedettariat. […]. Pour être pris en considération le frimeur recourt aux signes extérieurs ambulatoires comme l'automobile et aux signes extérieurs fixes comme la maison, le fin du fin consistant à faire stationner une automobile très puissante devant une maison très chère puisque l'impact de la frime se mesure a l'importance des capitaux investis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a041660-3b00-4cd5-98f2-8046b9125096",
                                                "sense_id": "c08b549b-4139-3dea-b8dd-0968ea161072",
                                                "text": "Suivirent des frimeuses téléphonant, des cadres sportifs, des exhibeurs de pectoraux, des enfants aux sourcils froncés d'inquiétude que leurs pères tenaient par la main, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "frimeur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe7b36a3-4545-3d98-8f61-d63804083919",
                                        "entry_id": "c5f2e871-febd-3b21-9845-04a37ef61053",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui frime ; qui crâne ; qui est prétentieux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7af8c61-2bc6-4019-98c4-59dc387fe8da",
                                                "sense_id": "fe7b36a3-4545-3d98-8f61-d63804083919",
                                                "text": "A leurs doigts sans cal, brillent de belles bagues d'or ou d'argent. Au poignet, de grosses montres frimeuses et sophistiquées classent leurs propriétaires ; elles peuvent aussi donner l'heure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
